      "commonError": "Using the wrong basket cost or forgetting to multiply by 100.",
      "q": "A CPI basket has 3 books and 2 meals. Base-year prices are $20 per book and $10 per meal. Current prices are $25 per book and $15 per meal. What is the current CPI?",
