      "repairSkill": "imports_exports_nx",
      "commonError": "Adding imports instead of subtracting them through net exports.",
      "q": "Consumption is $9T, investment is $3T, government purchases are $4T, exports are $2T, and imports are $3T. Then households buy $1T more imported goods, with no change in domestic production. What happens to measured GDP?",
