      "commonError": "Using the wrong basket cost or forgetting to multiply by 100.",
      "q": "A CPI basket contains 5 bus tickets and 2 meals. Base-year prices are $2 per bus ticket and $10 per meal. Current prices are $3 per bus ticket and $14 per meal. What is the CPI?",
